      <p class="micro">✓ Free shipping over $50 &nbsp;·&nbsp; ✓ 30-day money-back guarantee &nbsp;·&nbsp; ✓ Secure checkout</p>
      <div class="pay-row"><div class="pbadge">🔒 SSL Encrypted</div><div class="pbadge">💳 All major cards</div><div class="pbadge">🛡️ Secure checkout</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
